{"id":"9470641051e0a7af","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-sharp-p.md","title":"df-sharp-p (#P Counting-Function Class)","display":"df-sharp-p (#P Counting-Function Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-sharp-p (#P Counting-Function Class)","label":"28-df-sharp-p","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-sharp-p","#P","Sharp-P Counting Class"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 17.5; printed p.344; PDF p.370","source_printed_pages":"344","source_pdf_pages":"370","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sharp-p (#P Counting-Function Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-sharp-p"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-sharp-p</span><span>#P</span><span>Sharp-P Counting Class</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 17.5; printed p.344; PDF p.370"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"344"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"370"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 是在配对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 上的确定型比特输出判定机，时间与输出见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,y)\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}_{01}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" href=\"?note=0dfeff4bd5d69b86\" title=\"28-df-binary-pair-encoding\">28-df-binary-pair-encoding</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。量化变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 仅取下列类型的函数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的整数函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\">\\(\\#\\mathbf P\\)</span> 为计数函数类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M(x;y)\\coloneqq M(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{time}_M(x;y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,y\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M(x;y)\\coloneqq M(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{time}_M(x;y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,y\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\#\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\left\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;y)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;y)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land f(x)=\\left|\\{y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}:M(x;y)=1\\}\\right|\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\#\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\left\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;y)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;y)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land f(x)=\\left|\\{y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}:M(x;y)=1\\}\\right|\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>采用定义 17.5 的精确长度证书计数，避免把任意计算前缀误作独立接受分支。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 计数一次。输出至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{p(|x|)}\">\\(2^{p(|x|)}\\)</span>，所以二进制输出长度为多项式；此处输出是函数而非语言。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 是在配对输入 $\\langle x,y\\rangle$ 上的确定型比特输出判定机，时间与输出见 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-binary-pair-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"0dfeff4bd5d69b86","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,y)$，$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]，$x,y\\in\\Sigma^*$。量化变量 $p$ 仅取下列类型的函数：$p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 是一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界的整数函数。$\\#\\mathbf P$ 为计数函数类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle x,y\\rangle=\\operatorname{pair}_{01}(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}_{01}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\#\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"M(x;y)\\coloneqq M(\\langle x,y\\rangle),\\qquad\\operatorname{time}_M(x;y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{time}_M(\\langle x,y\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\#\\mathbf P\\coloneqq\\left\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists p\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;y)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;y)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land f(x)=\\left|\\{y\\in\\Sigma^{p(|x|)}:M(x;y)=1\\}\\right|\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"2^{p(|x|)}","display":false}],"bytes":1760,"backlinks":[{"id":"86f066ce34d052a8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f,g:\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathbf{FP}$ 采用 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的全字符串函数接口，$\\#\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]。\n$\\operatorname{bin}:\\mathbb N\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$。本条的下标 $\\mathrm{par}$ 专指精确保持计数的归约。"},{"id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\#\\mathbf P$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]。$\\overline{\\mathbb N}=\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$，时间的上确界取于此有序集；$\\iota$ 表示唯一描述。$O^g(x)$ 为字符串输出或 $\\uparrow$，自然数输出使用 $\\operatorname{bin}$ 编码。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"计数复杂性：[[28-df-sharp-p]]、[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]、[[28-thm-toda]]。"},{"id":"533a7b5c79de3204","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\#\\mathrm{SAT}$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-sat]]；$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_{\\mathrm{par}}$ 与 $\\le_{\\mathrm{par}}^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-counting-reduction]]；图灵完全性见 [[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n采用 [[28-thm-cook-levin]] 的确定型验证计算编码；所有证书长度固定为 [[28-df-sharp-p]] 的 $p(|x|)$，不同证书不按计算前缀重复计数。"},{"id":"7d917c014b32a7f2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\#\\mathbf P$、$\\#\\mathbf P\\mathrm{Complete}_T$ 见 [[28-df-sharp-p]]、[[28-df-sharp-p-oracle]]。\n$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$A=(a_{ij})_{i,j\\in[n]}\\in\\Sigma^{n\\times n}$；$S_n$ 是 $[n]$ 上的置换群，数值空乘积为 $1$；$\\langle b\\rangle$ 为比特 $b$ 的单字符字串。$\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm{mat}}$ 将一元维数与逐行矩阵位拼接，编码式中的字串乘积按行优先依次连接（空字串乘积为 $\\varepsilon$）；$z\\in\\Sigma^*$。"}],"outgoing":["0dfeff4bd5d69b86","1965e2b0765554c9","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}